MySQLi for mysqlnd with OpenSSL: the module mysqli of php81-mysqli, the
same build, with php81-mysqlnd-openssl instead of php81-mysqlnd. The
same files as php81-mysqli: install one of the two.

The module mysqli of PHP 8.1 for php81 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20210902/mysqli.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php81/conf.d, its
headers in include/php81/php/ext/mysqli.
